    <title lang="fr">Les nouvelles frontières de l'espace</title>
    <sub-title lang="fr">Mars : exploration et conquête</sub-title>
    <desc lang="fr">As the latest successes and failures come and go Mars continues to give up her secrets. Invisible clouds are revealed with ultraviolet light and the search for the source of methane continues with ExoMars. As we prepare to land humans on the red planet, getting there is one thing; staying long term is another, can we really conquor this planet?</desc>
