    <sub-title lang="fr">Gujarat: Land Of Extremes</sub-title>
    <desc lang="fr">The people and wildlife of the western state of Gujarat have found ways to survive in an inhospitable environment. Unique big game exists side-by-side with some of the most talented and unique craftsman in the world. Bill gets the inside scoop on this strange land and is doubly surprised by his local guide.</desc>
