    <title lang="fr">Travel Thru History</title>
    <sub-title lang="fr">Ottawa</sub-title>
    <desc lang="fr">We visit Canada's capital city on a hill in Ottawa, Ontario. We'll sail down the famous Rideau Canal locks. We go deep into Ottawa's cold war history at the Diefenbunker, as well as, explore Canada's military history at the Canadian War Museum. Then we head up the Peace Tower and take a look at the library of Parliament. Finally, we learn about Canada's first nation's tribes at the Canadian History Museum.</desc>
    <category lang="fr">Documentaire de société</category>
