    <title lang="fr">Travel Thru History</title>
    <sub-title lang="fr">Oslo</sub-title>
    <desc lang="fr">We set sail to the land of the Norseman in Oslo, Norway. We'll climb the fort walls at Akershus Fortress and discover the North and South Poles at the Fram Museum. Then, we'll unearth ancient viking ship treasures at the Viking Ship Museum, and we'll brave the open waters of the Pacific with Thor Heyerdahl at the Kon-tiki museum.</desc>
